  m_text: '<b><size=40>Loading</size></b>


    Import the mukaderabbit.humr Unitypackage
    into any Unity project and attach the HumrRecordingLoader component to an animator
    with a human avatar. Select the VRChat log file with your recording takes from
    the list and export it as either .fbx or .anim.


